CAVEAT:  Only TWO equal-cost paths were exercised. Group sizes of 3-8
         (`maximum-paths <1-8>`) were NOT measured, and neither was the guide's
         claim that the default group size is 4 -- a third path needs a bench
         change, not a test change. `weight <1-255>` was NOT measured, although
