TOPOLOGY AS TESTED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   The two equal-cost next hops are ONE LINK TO EACH PARTNER. Spanning tree here is
   single-instance RSTP, so a parallel pair between the same two bridges is broken
   at one end whichever bridge is root, and a Discarding port is blocked for every
   VLAN. A star of one link per partner is loop-free, so BOTH legs forward with
   spanning tree left enabled and doing its job.

