STEP 1 -- add the second equal-cost next hop                                     PASS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Guide authority, Route Selection FOG C613-22029-00 REV G pp.10-11, verbatim:
  > "The software determines that two or more routes are equal cost if they have the
  >  same destination IP address and mask, Administrative Distance, Metric, and
  >  protocol. When the software learns such multiple routes, it puts them in an
  >  ECMP route group. When it sends traffic to that destination, it distributes the
  >  traffic across all routes in the group."

